WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: haw

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Aloha, ʻo Manner Code kēia.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
He paʻakikī ka polokalamu

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
ʻO ka mea mua, he nui nā code e pono e kākau ʻia.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
ʻO nā papahana hoʻohālike wale nō aʻu i hana ai no kēia moʻo

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
ʻOi aku ka lōʻihi o ke code ma mua o 12,000 mau laina.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Inā he lawelawe hana maoli ia

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
ʻOiai inā he lawelawe liʻiliʻi ia, e ʻoi aku ia ma mua o 100,000 mau laina.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Hoʻokahi haneri tausani laina ua lawa ia e hoʻopiha i nā puke moʻolelo he iwakālua.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
ʻO ke kākau ʻana i ke code lōʻihi ʻaʻole ia e manaʻo ua pau.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Pono ʻoe e hoʻoponopono mau i ke code āu i kākau ai.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
Inā hoʻoponopono ʻoe iā A, e haki ʻo B.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
Inā ʻoe e hoʻoponopono i ka B, e haki ʻo A a me C.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
I ka hoʻohana ʻana i kahi hoʻohālikelike, ua like ia me ke paʻa ʻia ʻana i loko o kahi Rasputica a uē.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Hiki iā ʻoe ke ʻōlelo he kūlana like ia me ka lio.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
I loko o kēia manawa, e ʻike ʻoe i ka pono no ka hoʻolālā.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Akā ke ho'āʻo maoli ʻoe e kākau i kahi palapala hoʻolālā,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
Ke hōʻike pololei nei i nā manaʻo i loko o kou poʻo

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
E ʻike ʻoe ʻaʻole ia he mea maʻalahi e like me kou manaʻo.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
ʻOiai nā pepa mele, ʻo ia hoʻi kahi palapala e hoʻopaʻa maka ana i ke kani a i ʻole ke mele,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
He paʻakikī kēia

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
ʻAʻole wale ke mele, akā, ʻo ke kālā a me ka logistics hoʻi

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Nā manaʻo like ʻole a me nā koi mea hoʻohana abstract

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
ʻAʻole hiki ke maʻalahi ke hōʻike iā ia ma kahi kumu hoʻohālike kikoʻī.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
ʻO ka mea pōmaikaʻi

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
No ka lanakila ʻana i ka paʻakikī o ke kumu hoʻohālike ʻana i nā manaʻo abstract

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
Ua hānau ʻia ʻo UML i ka hopena o nā makahiki 1990.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Ua alakaʻi ʻia e Grady Butch.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
Hoʻohana mākou iā UML me ka manaʻolana

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
E kaha kiʻi i kahi kiʻikuhi papa

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
E kahakiʻi pū kākou i kahi kiʻikuhi moʻo

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
akā naʻe

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
I koʻu hoʻāʻo ʻana e hoʻolālā, ua ʻokoʻa ia mai ke code pololei ʻana.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
ʻAʻole like ia me he mea lā he ʻokoʻa loa

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
No ke aha lā ia?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
No ka mea, ua maʻa ke kaʻina hana noʻonoʻo i ka hoʻokō ʻana.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Ma mua o ka hoʻolilo ʻana i nā manaʻo abstract i mea paʻa,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
No ka mea, unuhi ia i ka noʻonoʻo pae hoʻokō i loko o UML.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
No ka mea hiki iā ʻoe ke heluhelu i nā pepa mele

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
ʻAʻole like me ka hiki iaʻu ke haku mele

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
No ka mea ua aʻo ʻoe iā UML

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
ʻAʻole like me ʻoe e hoʻomohala i nā mākau hoʻolālā.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
No laila ma kēia moʻo

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Ma o nā papahana maoli

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Pehea e hoʻokūpaʻa ai i nā pono abstract

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
Hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻohui i ke code?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Makemake au e hōʻike iā ʻoe ma ke kino

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Ua koho au e hoʻopaʻa i nā tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni ma o ka inoa kikowaena

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
He maʻalahi ka hoʻomaopopo ʻana i nā hoʻopaʻa tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni no ka mea he mau ʻano kamaʻāina lākou.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Hoʻokomo pū ʻia nā hana like ʻole e like me ke komo ʻana, ka uku ʻana, a me ke koho ʻana i nā noho.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Me he mea lā he laʻana maikaʻi ia

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
ʻO ke kumu, ʻo ke kumuhana o kēia ʻatikala ka hoʻolālā polokalamu, akā

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
E uhi pū mākou i ka hoʻomohala hoʻāʻo.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Kākoʻo maoli nā ʻōnaehana hoʻomohala hou i nā mea hana hoʻāʻo.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
ʻOiai inā ʻoe e nānā i nā papahana open source kaulana,

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Loaʻa iā mākou kahi pae hoʻāʻo.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
ʻO ke ʻano paha kēia he mea nui loa ka hoʻāʻo ʻana a me ka pono.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Akā i ka ʻoiaʻiʻo

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
I nā manawa he nui, ʻaʻole wale ʻo TDD, akā ʻaʻole hoʻi i hoʻokō pono ʻia ka automation hoʻāʻo.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
ʻO ke kākau ʻana i nā hoʻokolohua koʻikoʻi mua me ka ʻole o ka hoʻomākaukau ʻana

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
ʻAʻole loa ia he mea maʻalahi

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
He mea kēia e pono ai ka hui pū ʻana o nā hiki o ka hoʻolālā polokalamu.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
No laila, ʻoi aku ka maikaʻi o ka hana pū ʻana me ka hoʻolālā a me ka TDD.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Ua manaʻo wau he kūpono ia

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
No laila, e hoʻomaka kākou i ka hālāwai mua o ka papahana.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
No ka mea, he papahana liʻiliʻi kēia

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
ʻElua mau mea hele mai

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
ʻO ka mea ma ka hema he loea kikowaena pūnaewele, a ʻo ka mea ma ka ʻākau he mea hoʻomohala pūnaewele.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
He ʻōlelo ko ka poʻe loea kikowaena pūnaewele i nā ʻōnaehana e pono ai mākou e kūkulu.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
He nui nā moʻolelo e haʻi mai ana

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
ʻO ka hale keaka a mākou e holo nei

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Aia ma kahi o ʻehā tausani o lākou ma ka ʻāina.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Hiki ke hoʻonui hou aku i ka wā e hiki mai ana.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
I kēia manawa, ʻo ka hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni wale nō ke kākoʻo ʻia nei.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Hoʻolālā mākou e hoʻohui i nā kūʻai tikiki no nā hōʻike nui ma hope.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
A ʻo ka mea nui, ʻaʻole loa ʻoe e hoʻopaʻa pālua i nā noho.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
I ka wā ma mua, ua paʻakikī loa nā kikowaena lawelawe mea kūʻai aku me kēlā ʻano pilikia.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
No ka mea, ua nui ka ʻike kiʻiʻoniʻoni a me ka ʻikepili loiloi i hōʻiliʻili mua ʻia.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Pono e noho paʻa kēia mau ʻikepili.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
Maanei ua hoʻonohonoho maikaʻi ʻia ke kamaʻilio ʻana, akā

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
ʻOiaʻiʻo, aia nā ʻike hou aku

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
E hāʻawi ʻia ia ma ke ʻano hoʻonohonoho ʻole ʻia

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Akā, ʻo ka moʻolelo e puka mai ana i ka hoʻomaka ʻana o ka papahana, ʻo ia

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
No ka mea, ʻo ia ka mea nui loa e pono ai

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.320
Pono ʻoe e hoʻolohe pono

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.810
Hoʻolohe nā mea hoʻomohala i nā loea kikowaena

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.290
He mau nīnau kaʻu

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.660
ʻO ka hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki hana nui āu i ʻōlelo ai

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.910
Āhea e hoʻohui ʻia ai?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.910
Pono anei e hoʻokomo ʻia kēia i loko o ka laulā o kēia papahana ma mua?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.590
A i ʻole makemake wau e ʻike inā pono iaʻu e noʻonoʻo iā ia

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.090
A me ka pono e mālama i ka ʻikepili o kēia manawa

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.940
ʻO ke ʻano anei kēia ʻaʻole pono mākou e hoʻololi i ka ʻōnaehana DB?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.950
Aia kekahi mau lawelawe ʻē aʻe e kaʻana like ana i ka DB i kēia manawa?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.980
E like me kāu e ʻike ai mai ka DB,

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.290
No ka mea, ʻaʻole he poʻe hoʻomohala nā loea kikowaena pūnaewele.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.430
He kānalua ka ʻōlelo loea

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.890
Pono nā mea hoʻomohala e nānā pono i kēia mau mea.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.450
Pane nā loea kikowaena i nā nīnau a nā mea hoʻomohala penei:

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.210
Ka hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki hana nui

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.450
ʻAʻohe papa hana kikoʻī i kēia manawa.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.970
Eia nō naʻe, ke hoʻohui ʻia nā hiʻohiʻona i ka wā e hiki mai ana

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.700
I hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻonui me ka ʻole o ka pilikia nui

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.600
Manaʻo wau he mea maikaʻi inā hiki iā ʻoe ke noʻonoʻo iki i kēia manawa.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:27.050
ʻAʻole mākou e hoʻohana iā DB no kekahi mea ʻē aʻe ma mua o kā mākou lawelawe.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:32.840
ʻAʻole pilikia nui ka hoʻololi ʻana i ka ʻōnaehana inā mālama maikaʻi ʻia ka ʻikepili.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.080
Ma hope o ka lohe ʻana i ka moʻolelo

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:39.400
ʻAʻole au i manaʻo he pono ʻoe e hopohopo e pili ana i ka hōʻike nui.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.790
ʻAʻole ia ka laulā o ka papahana

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.040
ʻAʻole maopopo hoʻi nā koi

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.930
ʻAʻole maopopo iaʻu ka wā e pono ai iaʻu, akā

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.710
He pilikia kēlā e pono ai mākou e loiloi hou ma hope.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.910
ʻOiai inā ʻaʻole i hoʻopaʻa ʻia ma ka palapala

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.880
E hāʻawi pū nā loea kikowaena i kahi pane e noʻonoʻo lākou i nā hana nui.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.960
ʻAʻole pono ʻoe e poina

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.320
Hiki nō

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.630
A laila, ka hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki hana nui

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.500
ʻAʻole au e kau i kēia ma waena o nā mea nui loa no kēia papahana.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.220
Akā, e maʻalahi ia e hoʻonui i ka hana ma hope o ke kaʻina hana hoʻomohala.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.190
E mālama pono wau ia mea

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.840
Mai hopohopo. E hilinaʻi wale mai iaʻu

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.960
He mea nui e launa maikaʻi

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.500
Ma o kā mākou kamaʻilio ʻana a hiki i kēia manawa

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.700
Ua hōʻuluʻulu ʻia nā mea nui loa penei:

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.890
ʻO kēia ka ʻike i hāʻawi ʻia e nā loea kikowaena pūnaewele.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.410
Ka wehewehe ʻana a me ka hoʻonohonoho ʻana mai ka manaʻo o ka mea hoʻomohala

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.810
E hoʻomaka i ka papahana

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.860
Me nā loea kikowaena pūnaewele

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.980
Ke hoʻoholo ʻoe i nā pahuhopu o kāu papahana,

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.980
ʻĀnō ka manawa e kapa inoa ai i kāu papahana.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.840
ʻO ka mea mua, e nīnau i kahi loea pūnaewele no ko lākou manaʻo.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.540
He aha kaʻu e kapa ai i ka papahana?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.680
He ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni ia.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.150
Pehea e pili ana i ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.430
ʻaʻole, ʻaʻole au makemake

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.570
Naʻu e mālama i nā hana nui

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.930
E hele kākou me ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni. ʻAe?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.180
nui

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.950
Mahalo nui iā ʻoe

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.230
Makemake paha nā loea kikowaena inoa i nā inoa papahana ma ka ʻōlelo Kōlea.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.680
Akā mai ka manaʻo o ka mea hoʻomohala

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.990
Nā huaʻōlelo a pau me nā inoa papahana

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.180
No ka mea ua hoʻokō pololei ʻia i loko o ke code,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.000
Inā hiki, e maʻalahi ka wehewehe ʻana ma ka ʻōlelo Pelekania.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.510
He mea nui i nā mea hoʻomohala e hahai pono i nā pono o nā loea kikowaena, akā

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.430
Ke noʻonoʻo nei i ka papahana holoʻokoʻa

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.930
He kuleana ko kākou e hoʻokele i nā mea ma ke ala kūpono.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.760
Inā ua hoʻoholo ʻoe i kahi inoa no kāu papahana

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.380
ʻĀnō ka manawa e ʻike ai i ka mea nāna e hoʻohana i ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.940
ʻOiaʻiʻo, pono ʻoe e nīnau i kahi loea kikowaena no ka ʻike e pili ana i kēia.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.740
A ke ʻike nei mākou he mau mea kūʻai aku a me nā luna hoʻokele kā mākou.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.280
ʻO kekahi o nā mea i maʻalahi ke nalo i nā pae mua o ka hoʻolālā ʻana, ʻo ia

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.760
He hilinaʻi kūwaho ia

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.580
ʻO nā hilinaʻi o waho

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.210
He ʻōnaehana hoʻoilina paha ia e kū nei,

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.420
He ʻōnaehana uku paha ia

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.670
ʻO kēia pilina hilinaʻi

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.760
No ka mea hiki iā ia ke loaʻa ka hopena nui ma ka hoʻolālā holoʻokoʻa o ka ʻōnaehana.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.150
He mea nui e ʻike iā ia i ka wā hikiwawe loa.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.240
me ka pōmaikaʻi

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.990
Nā mea e like me nā puka uku a me nā ʻōnaehana hoʻoilina

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.730
No ka mea, ke hoʻohana mua ʻia nei ia i nā ʻōnaehana e kū nei

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.360
Hiki ke hoʻomaopopo maʻalahi ʻia

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.410
ʻO kekahi o nā mea i maʻalahi ke nānā ʻole ʻia i loko o kahi pilina hilinaʻi

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.090
Aia nā kumu kaiapuni o waho

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.060
Aia ko mākou ʻāina ma ka ʻāpana manawa like

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.430
Ma kahi ʻāina me ka ʻāina nui, ʻokoʻa ka manawa o kēlā me kēia hale keaka.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.100
A laila ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.900
He mea hiki ʻole ke pale ʻia mai ka hoʻopilikia ʻia e nā kumu o ke kaiapuni e like me nā ʻāpana manawa.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.760
ʻAʻole ʻike koke ʻia kēia mau mea ke ʻole ʻoe e nīnau pololei i ka loea kikowaena.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.950
He mea maʻalahi ke nalo

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.610
Hoʻopoina pinepine nā loea kikowaena i kēia mau kikoʻī.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.010
No ka mea, hiki ke kāpae ʻia ka wehewehe ʻana

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.640
ʻOiai ua hōʻike maopopo ʻia ka pilina hilinaʻi

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.500
I kēia manawa, e nānā kākou i nā mea o loko o ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:52.230
ʻO ka mea mua, he aha ka hana a ka mea kūʻai aku ma ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
E nīnau kākou i nā loea kikowaena pūnaewele

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
He aha ka hana a nā mea kūʻai aku?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Ke ʻimi nei nā mea kūʻai aku i nā kiʻiʻoniʻoni,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
E nānā i nā kikoʻī o ke kiʻiʻoniʻoni,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
E koho i kahi manawa hōʻike,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
E koho i kou noho,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
E hoʻopaʻa i nā tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
E nānā i nā kikoʻī hoʻopaʻa,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
E hana i nā mea e like me ke kāpae ʻana i kahi hoʻopaʻa

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Ke koho nei i kahi manawa hōʻikeʻike a me ke koho ʻana i kahi noho he ʻāpana o ke kaʻina hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
A e hoʻopaʻa i nā tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni, e hoʻōki i nā hoʻopaʻa ʻana

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
Ma hope o nā mea a pau, ʻaʻole anei ʻoe e kūʻai wale ana i kahi tikiki a loaʻa iā ʻoe kahi uku hoʻihoʻi?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
pololei ʻoe

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Pololei kēnā

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
No ka mea, he ʻāina kamaʻāina ia i kēia manawa

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
E koho i kahi manawa hōʻike a koho i kou noho

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
He ʻāpana kēia o ke kaʻina hana hoʻopaʻa tikiki kiʻiʻoniʻoni?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Hiki iaʻu ke nīnau

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Akā inā he kahua kamaʻāina ʻole ia,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Ke nānā pono ʻana i kēlā me kēia hihia hoʻohana

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
E hana hou ʻoe i ke kaʻina hana hoʻomaʻemaʻe i nā manawa he nui.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Ma muli o ke kūlana o ka papahana

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Hiki iā ʻoe ke hana hou i kēia kaʻina hana i nā manawa he nui,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
ʻO ka nui o kou manawa e hoʻolōʻihi ai a kālailai pono,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
E hōʻemi i ka hoʻāʻo a me ka hewa i ka wā o ka hoʻolālā a me ka hoʻokō ʻana.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Ma muli o ke kamaʻilio ʻana a hiki i kēia manawa

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Ua hoʻonohonoho mākou i nā hihia hoʻohana a kā mākou mea kūʻai aku i ʻehā mau māhele:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
ʻO ka luna hoʻomalu ka mea aʻe

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Hiki i ka luna hoʻomalu ke ʻike he ʻelima mau mea hoʻokele:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
ʻO wau iho, ua akahele wau e pili ana i ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka huaʻōlelo "Manage" i ka hoʻomohala ʻana.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
He ʻōlelo ākea loa ka hoʻokele

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
ʻAʻole maopopo ka mea āu e hana nei

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Pēlā nō hoʻi ma ʻaneʻi

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Pehea pololei e mālama ʻia ai?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
ʻaʻole maopopo iaʻu

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Ma ke kamaʻilio ʻana me nā loea kikowaena

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Ua hoʻonui ʻia kēlā me kēia mea hoʻokele i kahi hihia hoʻohana kikoʻī.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Inā he papahana maoli ia

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Aia paha he nui aku nā hihia hoʻohana ma mua o kēia.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Maanei ua hoʻomaʻalahi wau iā ia no ka wehewehe ʻana.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
ʻO ka mea nui e hoʻomaopopo ma aneʻi, ke hana ʻoe i kahi manawa holo,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Hiki iā ʻoe ke ʻike ua hana ʻia hoʻi ka tikiki

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
A i ke kūʻai ʻana a i ʻole ka hoʻihoʻi kālā ʻana i kahi tikiki

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Hiki iā ʻoe ke ʻike e hoʻohana mākou i kahi lawelawe waho i kapa ʻia he gateway uku.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Ua hoʻohui au i nā hihia hoʻohana o nā mea kūʻai aku a me nā luna.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Ke nānā nei i ka hihia hoʻohana holoʻokoʻa e like me kēia

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Manaʻo ʻole kekahi mea

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Aia kahi koho e hoʻohui i kahi hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
ʻAʻole au e ʻike i kekahi mea e like me Search Theater

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Me he mea lā he nui nā hihia hoʻohana e kāpae ʻia ana.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
No ka mea, mai ka manaʻo o kahi loea i kahi ʻāpana, nui nā mea e wehewehe ai.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
ʻO kēia hihia hoʻohana, ka mea i ʻike maopopo ʻia,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Hiki iā ʻoe ke haʻalele i ka wehewehe ʻana

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
No laila pehea e pili ana i ka manaʻo o ka mea hoʻomohala?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
He mea maikaʻi ke kāpae ʻana i nā hihia nūhou maʻalahi e like me ka ʻimi ʻana i kahi hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
ʻAʻole anei e ʻoi aku ka kōkua o kēia no ka hoʻokele palapala?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Inā he hoʻolālā hope ia

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Nā hiʻohiʻona hoʻohana maʻalahi e like me ka ʻimi ʻana i kahi hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Manaʻo wau he mea maikaʻi ke kāpae iā ia

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
ʻO kaʻu e ʻōlelo nei, ʻaʻole i lohi loa ka pane ʻana i ka wā o ka hoʻokō ʻana.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Akā inā he papahana maoli ia

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
No nā mea hoʻolālā pale, he wahi hoʻomaka maikaʻi kēia mau hihia hoʻohana.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Ua nānā ka mea hoʻolālā i ka hihia hoʻohana o ka ʻimi ʻana i kahi hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Pehea e hiki ai iaʻu ke ʻimi i nā hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
E hiki iā ʻoe ke noʻonoʻo

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Ke hoʻohui ʻoe i nā kiʻikuhi i hoʻokahi, he paʻakikī ke ʻano.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Inā he papahana maoli, inā e ʻoi aku ka paʻakikī.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
I kēia hihia, ʻaʻohe pono e hoʻoikaika i ka hui ʻana.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Ua hoʻohui wale aku nei au iā lākou ma ʻaneʻi e hōʻike i nā hihia i nalowale.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Ua hoʻopiha au i nā hihia i nalowale a pau

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Loaʻa iaʻu kahi hihia hoʻohana kahi i kāpae ʻia ai ka pilina me ka mea hana.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Pili kēia i nā mea kūʻai aku a me nā luna hoʻokele.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
A no ka maʻalahi o ka hoʻokō ʻana, ua kākau wau ia mea ma ka ʻōlelo Pelekania.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Ua maikaʻi i kēia manawa no ka mea he papahana liʻiliʻi ia

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Inā nui a paʻakikī ka papahana

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Ma hea kahi e hoʻomaka ai kahi loea kikowaena e wehewehe?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
He mea paʻakikī paha

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
He aha ka hana a ka luna hoʻomalu?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
He nui ka hana

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
E like me ka mea i manaʻo ʻia mai ka luna hoʻokele

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
I kēia hihia, hiki iā mākou ke hoʻokaʻawale i nā mea hana keaka?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
He manaʻo maikaʻi nō hoʻi e nānā hou aku

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
I kinohi ua kapa ʻia au he luna hoʻomalu

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Hiki paha ke hoʻokaʻawale ʻia ma ke kuleana

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
A me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka ʻōnaehana hoʻopaʻa kiʻiʻoniʻoni

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Aia paha he mau lawelawe o waho

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Inā mākou e hoʻokaʻawale i nā mea hana keaka e like me kēia,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
E hiki i nā loea kikowaena ke hāʻawi i ka ʻike ʻōnaehana hou aku.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
ʻOiaʻiʻo, hoʻokahi wale nō laʻana kēia o ke kālailai ʻana i kahi ʻāpana paʻakikī.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Aia paha he mau ala maikaʻi ʻē aʻe

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
He mea nui e pane maʻalahi ma muli o ke kūlana.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
ʻO kēia ka hopena

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
I kēia manawa, e hoʻohana mākou i kahi kiʻikuhi hoʻohana

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
E hoʻonohonoho i nā pahuhopu no ka papahana

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Ua hala au i nā pae mua o ka nānā ʻana.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
ʻO wau iho, i ke kaʻina hana hoʻomohala holoʻokoʻa

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Manaʻo wau ʻo ka loiloi ka mea paʻakikī loa

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
No ka mea, pono mākou e hoʻonohonoho i nā manaʻo pohihihi a maopopo ʻole loa.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
I ka manawa aʻe e nānā mākou i nā hihia hoʻohana nui

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
E kālailai kākou iā ia me nā kikoʻī hou aku

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Mahalo no kāu hana nui a hiki i kēia manawa.

